00:34:16,146 --> 00:34:18,063
Whether they move forward or stay put

531
00:34:18,146 --> 00:34:19,980
<i>is up to them now.</i>

532
00:34:20,646 --> 00:34:22,021
You said before

533
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:25,563
that you couldn't have sex yet.

534
00:34:27,438 --> 00:34:29,480
Is that why you came here?

535
00:34:33,271 --> 00:34:34,271
Yeah.

536
00:34:34,355 --> 00:34:36,396
<i>Isn't it about time you told him</i>

537
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:40,188
why you've been cold to him

538
00:34:40,855 --> 00:34:43,021
and the reasons behind it?

539
00:34:57,855 --> 00:34:58,896
What…

540
00:35:00,271 --> 00:35:01,896
are you thinking right now?

541
00:35:06,855 --> 00:35:08,480
That your hand

542
00:35:09,980 --> 00:35:11,605
feels warm.

543
00:35:43,313 --> 00:35:44,730
I hope you get better.

544
00:35:49,021 --> 00:35:52,563
I hope that someday

545
00:35:53,688 --> 00:35:56,730
we can truly connect with each other…

546
00:35:58,980 --> 00:36:04,146
when we make love.

547
00:36:18,105 --> 00:36:19,105
Thank you.

548
00:36:36,563 --> 00:36:40,980
KAWAWA SHRINE

549
00:37:39,563 --> 00:37:40,980
Natsume, Saikawa…

550
00:37:48,521 --> 00:37:50,813
You can head home now.

551
00:37:51,896 --> 00:37:53,313
Have a good evening.

552
00:38:15,230 --> 00:38:16,355
Got a minute?

553
00:38:18,938 --> 00:38:19,896
We're closed for--

554
00:38:19,980 --> 00:38:21,105
Could you

555
00:38:22,188 --> 00:38:23,730
take a look at this?

556
00:38:26,438 --> 00:38:27,813
I went there myself.

557
00:38:32,605 --> 00:38:35,188
You know this place too,
don't you, Doctor?

558
00:41:22,521 --> 00:41:24,438
Subtitle translation by: Yuki Asami

